{#- Telegram alert (api-spec "Telegram Message Format"). Used for every message;
    message_en / message_ms come from the Alert Writer, or the fallback text below. -#}
{%- set icon = {"RED": "🔴", "AMBER": "🟠", "GREEN": "🟢"}[level] -%}
{%- set rate = rain_rate_max|round|int if rain_rate_max is not none else none -%}
{%- if cancelled -%}
❌ CANCELLED · {{ zone }}
EN: The earlier {{ level }} warning for {{ zone }} has been cancelled. Please disregard it.
BM: Amaran {{ level }} sebelum ini untuk {{ zone }} telah dibatalkan. Sila abaikan.
{%- else -%}
{{ icon }} {{ "ALL CLEAR" if all_clear else level }} · {{ zone }}
{% if message_en and message_ms -%}
EN: {{ message_en }}
BM: {{ message_ms }}
{%- elif all_clear -%}
EN: Heavy rain has eased. No significant rain expected in the next 3 h. Take care on wet roads.
BM: Hujan lebat telah reda. Tiada hujan ketara dijangka dalam 3 jam. Berhati-hati di jalan basah.
{%- elif level == "RED" -%}
{%- if rate is none -%}
EN: Intense rain likely in the next 3 h. Flash floods likely in low-lying roads. Avoid underpasses; move vehicles to higher ground.
BM: Hujan lebat berkemungkinan dalam 3 jam. Banjir kilat mungkin berlaku. Elakkan laluan bawah tanah; alihkan kenderaan ke tempat tinggi.
{%- elif eta_min == 0 -%}
EN: Intense rain (~{{ rate }} mm/h) is falling now. Flash floods likely in low-lying roads. Avoid underpasses; move vehicles to higher ground.
BM: Hujan lebat (~{{ rate }} mm/j) sedang turun. Banjir kilat mungkin berlaku. Elakkan laluan bawah tanah; alihkan kenderaan ke tempat tinggi.
{%- else -%}
EN: Intense rain (~{{ rate }} mm/h) expected in ~{{ eta_min }} min. Flash floods likely in low-lying roads. Avoid underpasses; move vehicles to higher ground.
BM: Hujan lebat (~{{ rate }} mm/j) dijangka dalam ~{{ eta_min }} minit. Banjir kilat mungkin berlaku. Elakkan laluan bawah tanah; alihkan kenderaan ke tempat tinggi.
{%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
{%- if rate is none or eta_min is none -%}
EN: Heavy rain possible in the next 3 h. Localised ponding likely. Drive slowly and avoid flood-prone roads.
BM: Hujan lebat mungkin berlaku dalam 3 jam. Air bertakung setempat mungkin berlaku. Pandu perlahan dan elakkan jalan mudah banjir.
{%- else -%}
EN: Heavy rain (~{{ rate }} mm/h) possible in ~{{ eta_min }} min. Localised ponding likely. Drive slowly and avoid flood-prone roads.
BM: Hujan lebat (~{{ rate }} mm/j) mungkin dalam ~{{ eta_min }} minit. Air bertakung setempat mungkin berlaku. Pandu perlahan dan elakkan jalan mudah banjir.
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
Updated {{ updated_myt }} MYT · {{ url }}
